## Deploying

Pushing to `develop`, `staging`, or `main` deploys to dev, staging, or prod through
GitHub Actions with short-lived AWS credentials (OIDC). Set up an AWS account once
with [docs/runbooks/aws-bootstrap.md](docs/runbooks/aws-bootstrap.md).

## Updating from the template

```bash
uvx copier update --trust
```

Copier replays your answers (stored in `.copier-answers.yml`) against the newest
template and merges the changes. Review the diff, resolve any conflicts, then run
`npm install` and `(cd apps/backend && uv lock)` to refresh the lockfiles.
